      "user": "{\"source_assignment\":{\"purpose\":\"acceptance_criterion: An observable pass/fail flow with a precondition, trigger and expected result. given: The starting situation before the trigger, without assuming the result being tested or inventing prerequisites. when: The action or event that triggers the behavior. then: The observable consequences after the trigger, including the obligations being tested.\\nuser_visible_outcome: A result, confirmation or response directly observable by the user.\\nedge_case: A boundary or exceptional condition and its expected outcome. condition: The boundary or exceptional condition. expected_outcome: The observable result, preserving conditions and obligations.\\nfunctional_requirement: Required application behavior, preserving its trigger, conditions and obligation strength.\\nbusiness_rule: A rule or constraint governing business decisions or outcomes.\\nassumption: A supported premise on which the described behavior depends.\\nnon_goal: Behavior explicitly excluded from the feature's scope.\\nprohibited_behavior: An action or behavior that must not occur.\\nentity: A business data concept with its meaning and relationships. name: The business entity's name. business_meaning: The entity's business purpose. relationships: The business relationship to another entity, including its meaning.\",\"signal\":3,\"requirements\":[{\"claim_id\":3,\"kind\":\"preserved_token\",\"meaning\":\"Renewal refused.\",\"source_id\":1}],\"kind\":\"records\"},\"source_groups\":[],\"context_requirements\":[{\"claim_id\":1,\"kind\":\"business\",\"meaning\":\"A borrower may renew an active loan that has not yet been renewed; the renewal extends the loan’s due date by fourteen calendar days and displays the message `Loan renewed!` along with the new due date. The loan may be renewed only once; if the loan is inactive or has already been renewed, the renewal is refused, the due date remains unchanged, and the message `Renewal refused.` is displayed.\",\"source_id\":1}],\"preserved_tokens\":[{\"claim_id\":2,\"value\":\"Loan renewed!\",\"source_id\":1},{\"claim_id\":3,\"value\":\"Renewal refused.\",\"source_id\":1}],\"sources\":[{\"id\":1,\"text\":\"# Library Loan Renewal\\n\\n## Requirements\\n\\n- A borrower must be able to renew an active loan that has not previously been renewed.\\n- Successful renewal must extend the existing due date by fourteen calendar days.\\n- After successful renewal, display `Loan renewed!` and the new due date to the borrower.\\n- A loan may be renewed only once.\\n- Refuse renewal if the loan is inactive or has previously been renewed; leave its due date unchanged and display `Renewal refused.`.\\n\"}],\"passive_literals\":[],\"operation\":\"write\",\"brief\":{\"title\":\"Loan renewed!Renewal refused.\",\"description\":\"A borrower may renew an active loan that has not yet been renewed; the renewal extends the loan’s due date by fourteen calendar days and displays the message Loan renewed! along with the new due date. The loan may be renewed only once; if the loan is inactive or has already been renewed, the renewal is refused, the due date remains unchanged, and the message Renewal refused. is displayed.\",\"primary_goal\":\"The feature enables borrowers to conveniently extend the loan period once, ensuring they can continue using the borrowed item without interruption.\"},\"record_requirements\":{\"scope\":\"assembled_specification\",\"required_families\":[\"acceptance_criterion\",\"functional_requirement\",\"entity\"],\"present_families\":[\"acceptance_criterion\",\"functional_requirement\",\"entity\"],\"unmet_required_families\":[]},\"entities\":{\"disposition\":\"required\",\"basis\":\"A borrower may renew an active loan that has not yet been renewed; the renewal extends the loan’s due date by fourteen calendar days and displays the message `Loan renewed!` along with the new due date. The loan may be renewed only once; if the loan is inactive or has already been renewed, the renewal is refused, the due date remains unchanged, and the message `Renewal refused.` is displayed.\"}}"
